## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Institutional Pricing & Quota Tiers (Proposed Defaults)**:
> - **Starter Campus**: Up to 250 Students — ₹25,000/year
> - **Standard College (Recommended / User Case)**: Up to 1,000 Students — ₹75,000/year
> - **University Enterprise**: Up to 5,000 Students — ₹2,50,000/year
> - **MoES Autonomous Centre**: Central Government Sponsored — ₹0 (Unlimited)
>
> Please confirm if these pricing tiers and student capacity numbers align with your desired fee structure.

> [!NOTE]
> **Free Access Enforcement Logic**:
> When an officer trainee attempts to enroll in a course, the server executes this rule:
> ```javascript
> if (user.organizationId && user.organization.subscriptionStatus === 'ACTIVE') {
>   // 100% FREE for Institute Students!
>   return enrollDirectlyWithoutPayment();
> } else {
>   // External / Independent student -> Launch Individual Payment Checkout
>   return requireCoursePayment(course.price);
> }
> ```

